= About Dogescript = 
Just a simple scripting language that probably sucks.

= Keywords
===================================================================
echo/print/println                  | prints text.
set                                 | set variable
unset                               | unset variable
inc                                 | increase var by one
dec                                 | decrease var by one
input                               | ask for keyboard input
read [variable] [filename]          | read a file
write [filename] [text]             | write a file
append [filename] [text]            | add a line of text to a file
exists [filename] -> [variable]     | check if smomething exists
isdir [filename] -> [variable]      | check if it's a dir
assert [something]                  | something
fail [text]                         | for custom error
break                               | break loop
exit [code]                         | exit
continue                            | skip a loop
====================================================================

